WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:19.360
Let me tell you a little secret, our master of&nbsp;
microscopes, James, will occasionally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.760
just email us pictures he has taken&nbsp;
of the microcosmos that are just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:29.040
stunning. We will get them and everyone&nbsp;
will fawn over them and then feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.216
very special that we got to see something so&nbsp;
amazing that brightened up our work day a little bit.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.640
Because, as we hope you have discovered&nbsp;
from watching this channel, there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:45.200
beauty in the invisible, and there is joy in&nbsp;
letting yourself fall into it for a while.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.720
And so we decided that we want to invite you into&nbsp;
that as well. We’ve put together 13 of James’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:56.800
stunning images in the 2023&nbsp;
Journey to the Microcosmos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.760
calendar. Each image is accompanied by a little&nbsp;
blurb explaining what it is you’re looking at,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:08.199
and each photo showcases both James’ work as&nbsp;
an artist, and the beauty of the microcosmos.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.640
Plus, you’re probably going to get a 2023
wall calendar, so why not support your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:19.040
favorite microscopic YouTube channel at the same time.&nbsp;
You can find it at ComplexlyCalendars.com,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.280
where some of the other shows from Complexly,&nbsp;
the company that produces this show,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:29.374
also have calendars available. There's SciShow 
and SciShow Space, Bizarre Beasts and Eons.

00:01:29.374 --> 00:01:32.161
Or if you don't want to type all that 
stuff out you can can just click the link

00:01:32.161 --> 00:01:37.200
in the description. Or the pinned comment.&nbsp;
Or anywhere else we could find to put it.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:42.160
We’re really excited to share the&nbsp;
microcosmos with you in all the ways that we do,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:46.480
but we only made a pretty limited number of these,&nbsp;
so we think they might sell out pretty fast.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:53.840
To get yours, just go to complexlycalendars.com&nbsp;
and again, the link is, somewhere nearby

